Description: multi-player tactical space war game
 XPilot is a multi-player tactical manoeuvring game. Each player controls a
 fighter equipped with a variety of weapons and power-ups. Players compete as
 teams or as individuals; the object is to score points by blasting the
 opposition, stealing their treasure, or racing round a circuit.
 .
 This package contains the server, both clients (SDL/OpenGL and X11), the
 replay tool and the map editor, along with the maps, textures, fonts and
 sounds they need.
 .
 It builds from a revival of XPilot NG 4.7.3, whose last upstream release was
 in 2010: ported to CMake, SDL2 and SDL2_mixer, and fixed to build and run on
 current systems.
